B.Qt=new A.j5("to my one and only.\n\nThank you for always being patient with me, especially sa mga times na hindi ako madaling intindihin. Thank you for understanding me, for staying, and for never giving up on us kahit may mga times na hindi tayo okay. I hope you know how much I appreciate you and how lucky I am to have you. Mahal na mahal talaga kita, love. Sana kahit anong mangyari, huwag tayong susuko sa isa\u2019t isa. Marami pa tayong plans, travels, and dreams na gusto nating matupad, and I want you to be part of every single one of them.\n\nSorry kung minsan nagkukulang ako or may mga times na hindi ko naibibigay yung attention and assurance na deserve mo. I know Im not perfect, and I still have a lot to learn, but please know na Im always willing to grow and become better for you and for us. Sana patuloy lang tayong mag-intindihan at magpasensya sa isat isa. Alam ko naman na hindi lahat ng araw magiging masaya. May mga tampuhan and misunderstandings talaga, pero sana lagi nating piliin na ayusin ang lahat kaysa sumuko. Kaya natin to basta magkasama tayo.\n\nAlam mo, masaya ako palagi kapag kasama kita. Kahit simpleng moments lang natin, sobrang naa-appreciate ko. You make me happy in ways na hindi mo siguro napapansin, and I hope you know how much you mean to me. Nandito lang ako palagi para sayo, love, through good days and bad days. I want you to feel loved and appreciated every single day because you deserve that and so much more.\n\nI want us to keep growing together, learning from each other, and becoming better partners. Gusto kong patuloy nating alagaan yung relationship natin and make sure na kahit anong mangyari, we never forget how much we love each other. Babawi ako sa mga pagkukulang ko, love, and Ill always do my best for us.\n\nI love you so much, my baby girl! Excited na akong makapag-travel pa tayo, makapunta sa mga places na gusto nating puntahan, and make more memories together. Gusto ko pang maranasan lahat ng bagay kasama ka, kahit yung mga simpleng araw lang na magkasama tayo. Marami pa tayong pagdadaanan, pero I hope we continue choosing each other every day.\n\nThank you for being you and for being part of my life. Mahal na mahal kita, always. \u2764\ufe0f\n\n\n\n maruee",null,B.MQ,null,null,null)
